.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH fujicli-simulation-import 1  "import "
.SH NAME
fujicli\-simulation\-import \- Import simulation
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfujicli simulation import\fR [\fB\-j\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-target\-serial\-sha256\fR> <\fISLOT\fR> <\fIINPUT\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import simulation
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-serial\-sha256\fR \fI<TARGET_SERIAL_SHA256>\fR
SHA\-256 fingerprint of the exact physical camera serial number
.TP
\fB\-j\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Format output using JSON
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-device\fR \fI<DEVICE>\fR
Manually specify target device using USB <BUS>.<ADDRESS>
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log extra debugging information (multiple instances increase verbosity)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISLOT\fR>
Simulation slot number
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Input file (use \*(Aq\-\*(Aq to read from stdin)
